      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hampton%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hampton was first settled in 1800 and featured a store, hotel, and a grist mill by 1880.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
